# `**/` matters: a pattern with a mid-string slash is anchored to this file's
# directory, so a bare `supabase/.temp/` only ever matched a root-level
# supabase/ — and this repo keeps it at packages/db/supabase/. The CLI writes
# link state (project ref, pooler URL) there on `supabase link`.
**/supabase/.temp/

